I'm been thinking there should be some way to make walls. No real 
reason, it just seems like a fun thing to do. So besides adding 
something totally new like a wand of walls, this seemed like the most 
logical way to do it:

Polymorph a boulder. Instead of a statue, it would turn into a wall.

"The shifting boulder merges with the walls." (If touching other walls.)
"The shifting boulder becomes welded to the floor." (Otherwise.)

If it was in a doorway, it would become a wall, otherwise, salid rock. 
(Though the difference is being main asthetic I guess.)

